    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**RoqueModel**: hour-by-hour probability that the dome is closed tonight at the Roque de los Muchachos Observatory (La Palma), because of humidity, wind or ice. Full explanation of the model on the [project's website](https://saimonx.github.io/roque-model/?lang=en). Updated every hour (GitHub Actions); these data arrive through FIWARE (Orion and QuantumLeap). **Independent project, not affiliated with GRANTECAN or any observatory.** Real, public data: NOT weather station and ECMWF and NOAA GFS forecasts via Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0). Times in Canary time."
   }
  },
